# Build context is the repo root; the service image needs service/ + knowledge-base/.
# Exclude everything heavy or host-specific, and never bake secrets in.
**/node_modules
**/.data
**/dist
**/.astro
**/.wrangler
.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
site
# packages/ is kept: the service imports packages/tax-engine/src.
workers
cms
scripts
docs
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
